@model PublishedNameCell
@* Under the year (or region) of an assessment table row: "as" + the name the assessment was
   published under (or the name in its DOI's title), when it differs from the taxon's current name,
   with the footnote that says where the name is from (HistoryTableNotes.NameFor). *@
<span class="published-name">@SiteText.PublishedAsBefore<span class="sci-name">@Html.Raw(ScientificNameMarkup.ToHtml(Model.Name.Name))</span><partial name="_FootnoteRef" model="Model.Footnote" /></span>
